export class ComprobanteErrorCtrl{static $inject=["$scope","mainService","commonService","$uibModalInstance","params","toastService"];constructor(n,t,i,r,u,f){this.$scope=n;this._mS=t;this.$uibModalInstance=r;this._params=u;this._ts=f;this.formatDate="MM/dd/yyyy h:mma"}$onInit(){this._mS.getData("get","FactElect/DocumentoElectronicoError/"+this._params.idDocumentoElectronico).then(n=>{this.erroresComprobante=n.payload||[]}).catch(n=>{n.data&&this._ts.toastr("error",n.data.message,n.status),console.log(n)})}showInfoAdicional(n){if(!n.informacionAdicional){this._ts.toastr("warning","No existe info adicional","Aviso!");return}Swal.fire({icon:"info",html:`<small>${n.informacionAdicional}</small>`})}closeModal(){this.$uibModalInstance.close()}}